<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Displace Magic</h1>
<p>Sphere: Protection Sphere
Class: Dark Knight (guild level 80)
Mana: 25
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cast displace magic &lt;target&gt;
cast displace magic &lt;object&gt;
</pre>
<p>The dark knights' answer to dispel magic: it tears spells off a person, a 
creature or an object, one after another. It removes, among others: bless, 
unholy blessing and condemn, the detect spells, invisibility, charm, hold, 
haste, quicken and slow, poison, mire, rage, berserk and focus, absorption, 
magic light and darkness, enchanted weapons and armour, and the raise 
spells. The better your spell, the more it removes: up to fifteen for a 
master.
</p><p>Like dispel magic, it also breaks spells such as sleep, plague and madness, 
when your spell is at least as strong as they were. It doesn't touch the 
resistances, sanctuary, the skin spells, protection from evil, life 
protection or sustain.
</p><p>It is harder work than dispel magic: each spell removed costs you 30 
endurance, and if your endurance runs out you fall stunned. You need more 
than 20 endurance to begin. You must be standing. It is also found on 
scrolls and wands.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
